ent-AnomalyScanner = 異常掃描器 | anomaly scanner
    .desc = 一款專為蒐集各類異常物體資訊而設計的手持式掃描器。 | A hand-held scanner built to collect information on various anomalous objects.
ent-AnomalyScannerAdmin = 管理員異常偵測器 | admin anomaly scanner
    .desc = 一款專為蒐集各類異常物體資訊而設計的手持式掃描器。這款似乎還具備幾項額外功能。 | A hand-held scanner built to collect information on various anomalous objects. This one seems to have a few extra features.
    .suffix = Admin
ent-AnomalyLocatorUnpowered = 異常定位器 | anomaly locator
    .desc = 一種專為協助定位異常現象而設計的裝置。你有檢查過那些氣體採礦者嗎？ | A device designed to aid in the locating of anomalies. Did you check the gas miners?
    .suffix = Always Powered
