ent-WeaponGauntletGorilla = G.O.R.I.L.L.A. 戰手套 | G.O.R.I.L.L.A. gauntlet
    .desc = 一款堅固耐用的研究設備。當以異變核心供電時，僅需一擊便能將異變物體擊飛至空中。 | A robust piece of research equipment. When powered with an anomaly core, a single blow can launch anomalous objects through the air.
